  "notes": "Image titled T-ETH-Lite ESP32 (ESP32 + Ethernet Module + TF card). Labels copied as printed, including repeated GPIO34, GPIO14 and GPIO13 callouts on two left-header pins each (silkscreen also repeats IO34, IO14, IO13). Silkscreen spellings (IO39, TXD, 5V IN, 5V OP...) placed first in functions. TF card, RTL8201 Ethernet and ETH_* tables are signal assignments without physical pins. USB-to-TTL adapter and POE Shield insets are separate accessories and were not transcribed."
